#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/systemd.xml:167
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of systemd"
msgstr "Instalação do \"systemd\""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/systemd.xml:170
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Remove two unneeded groups, <systemitem "
"class=\"groupname\">render</systemitem> and <systemitem "
"class=\"groupname\">sgx</systemitem>, from the default udev rules:"
msgstr ""
"Remova dois grupos desnecessários, <systemitem "
"class=\"groupname\">render</systemitem> e <systemitem "
"class=\"groupname\">sgx</systemitem>, das regras padrão do \"udev\":"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/systemd.xml:176
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">sed -i -e 's/GROUP=\"render\"/GROUP=\"video\"/' \\\n"
"       -e 's/GROUP=\"sgx\", //' rules.d/50-udev-default.rules.in</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">sed -i -e 's/GROUP=\"render\"/GROUP=\"video\"/' \\\n"
"      -e 's/GROUP=\"sgx\", //' rules.d/50-udev-default.rules.in</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/systemd.xml:180
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Rebuild <application>systemd</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Reconstrua o <application>systemd</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/systemd.xml:184
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup ..                \\\n"
"      --prefix=/usr           \\\n"
"      --buildtype=release     \\\n"
"      -Ddefault-dnssec=no     \\\n"
"      -Dfirstboot=false       \\\n"
"      -Dinstall-tests=false   \\\n"
"      -Dldconfig=false        \\\n"
"      -Dman=auto              \\\n"
"      -Dsysusers=false        \\\n"
"      -Drpmmacrosdir=no       \\\n"
"      -Dhomed=disabled        \\\n"
"      -Duserdb=false          \\\n"
"      -Dmode=release          \\\n"
"      -Dpam=enabled           \\\n"
"      -Dpamconfdir=/etc/pam.d \\\n"
"      -Ddev-kvm-mode=0660     \\\n"
"      -Dnobody-group=nogroup  \\\n"
"      -Dsysupdate=disabled    \\\n"
"      -Dukify=disabled        \\\n"
"      -Ddocdir=/usr/share/doc/systemd-&systemd-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup ..                \\\n"
"      --prefix=/usr           \\\n"
"      --buildtype=release     \\\n"
"      -Ddefault-dnssec=no     \\\n"
"      -Dfirstboot=false       \\\n"
"      -Dinstall-tests=false   \\\n"
"      -Dldconfig=false        \\\n"
"      -Dman=auto              \\\n"
"      -Dsysusers=false        \\\n"
"      -Drpmmacrosdir=no       \\\n"
"      -Dhomed=disabled        \\\n"
"      -Duserdb=false          \\\n"
"      -Dmode=release          \\\n"
"      -Dpam=enabled           \\\n"
"      -Dpamconfdir=/etc/pam.d \\\n"
"      -Ddev-kvm-mode=0660     \\\n"
"      -Dnobody-group=nogroup  \\\n"
"      -Dsysupdate=disabled    \\\n"
"      -Dukify=disabled        \\\n"
"      -Ddocdir=/usr/share/doc/systemd-&systemd-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/systemd.xml:213
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"For the best test results, make sure you run the test suite from a system "
"that is booted by the same <application>systemd</application> version you "
"are rebuilding."
msgstr ""
"Para os melhores resultados de teste, certifique-se de executar a suíte de "
"testes a partir de um sistema que seja inicializado pela mesma versão do "
"<application>systemd</application> que você estiver reconstruindo."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/systemd.xml:220
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To test the results, issue: <command>ninja test</command>.  The test named "
"<filename>test-stat-util</filename> is known to fail if some kernel features"
" are not enabled.  If the test suite is run as the &root; user, some other "
"tests may fail because they depend on various kernel configuration options."
msgstr ""
"Para testar os resultados, emita: <command>ninja test</command>. O teste "
"chamado <filename>test-stat-util</filename> é conhecido por falhar se alguns"
" recursos do núcleo não estiverem habilitados. Se a suíte de teste for "
"executada como o(a) usuário(a) &root;, alguns outros testes possivelmente "
"falhem, porque dependem de várias opções de configuração do núcleo."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/systemd.xml:229
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/systemd.xml:232
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/systemd.xml:237
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/systemd.xml:243
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-Dpamconfdir=/etc/pam.d</parameter>: Forces the PAM files to be "
"installed in /etc/pam.d rather than /usr/lib/pam.d."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-Dpamconfdir=/etc/pam.d</parameter>: Força os arquivos do \"PAM\""
" serem instalados em \"/etc/pam.d\" em vez de \"/usr/lib/pam.d\"."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/systemd.xml:248
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-Duserdb=false</parameter>: Removes a daemon that does not offer "
"any use under a BLFS configuration. If you wish to enable the "
"<application>userdbd</application> daemon, replace \"false\" with \"true\" "
"in the above meson command."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-Duserdb=false</parameter>: Remove um processo de segundo plano "
"que não oferece qualquer uso sob uma configuração do BLFS. Se você deseja "
"habilitar o processo de segundo plano <application>userdbd</application>, "
"[então] substitua \"false\" por \"true\" no comando \"meson\" acima."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/systemd.xml:255
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-Dhomed=disabled</parameter>: Removes a daemon that does not "
"offer any use under a traditional BLFS configuration, especially using "
"accounts created with useradd. To enable systemd-homed, first ensure that "
"you have <xref linkend=\"cryptsetup\"/> and <xref linkend=\"libpwquality\"/>"
" installed, and then change <quote>disabled</quote> to "
"<quote>enabled</quote> in the above <command>meson setup</command> command."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-Dhomed=disabled</parameter>: Remove um processo de segundo plano"
" que não oferece qualquer uso sob uma configuração tradicional do BLFS, "
"especialmente usando contas criadas com useradd. Para habilitar o systemd-"
"homed, primeiro certifique-se de que você tenha <xref "
"linkend=\"cryptsetup\"/> e <xref linkend=\"libpwquality\"/> instalados e, em"
" seguida, mude <quote>disabled</quote> para <quote>enabled</quote> no "
"comando <command>meson setup</command> acima."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/systemd.xml:264
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-Dukify=disabled</parameter>: Removes a script for combining a "
"kernel, an initramfs, and a kernel command line etc.  into an UEFI "
"application which can be loaded by the UEFI firmware to start the embedded "
"Linux kernel.  It's not needed for booting a BLFS system with UEFI if "
"following <xref linkend='grub-setup'/>.  And, it requires the "
"<application>pefile</application> Python module at runtime, so if it's "
"enabled but <application>pefile</application> is not installed, in the test "
"suite one test for it will fail.  To enable <command>systemd-"
"ukify</command>, install the <application>pefile</application> module and "
"then change <quote>disabled</quote> to <quote>enabled</quote> in the above "
"<command>meson setup</command> command."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-Dukify=disabled</parameter>: Remove um conjunto de comandos "
"sequenciais para combinar um núcleo, um initramfs e uma linha de comando do "
"núcleo, etc., em um aplicativo UEFI que pode ser carregado pelo firmware "
"UEFI para iniciar o núcleo incorporado Linux. Ele não é necessário para "
"inicializar um sistema BLFS com UEFI se seguir-se <xref linkend='grub-"
"setup'/>. E ele exige o módulo <application>pefile</application> do Python "
"em tempo de execução, de forma que, se estiver habilitado, mas "
"<application>pefile</application> não estiver instalado, na suíte de teste "
"um teste para ele falhará. Para habilitar o <command>systemd-"
"ukify</command>, instale o módulo <application>pefile</application> e, "
"então, mude <quote>disabled</quote> para <quote>enabled</quote> no comando "
"<command>meson setup</command> acima."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/systemd.xml:314
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring systemd"
msgstr "Configurando o \"systemd\""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/systemd.xml:317
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <filename>/etc/pam.d/system-session</filename> file needs to be modified"
" and a new file needs to be created in order for <command>systemd-"
"logind</command> to work correctly. Run the following commands as the "
"<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"O arquivo <filename>/etc/pam.d/system-session</filename> precisa ser "
"modificado e um novo arquivo precisa ser criado para a finalidade de que o "
"<command>systemd-logind</command> funcione corretamente. Execute os "
"seguintes comandos como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/systemd.xml:323
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>grep 'pam_systemd' /etc/pam.d/system-session ||\n"
"cat &gt;&gt; /etc/pam.d/system-session &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Begin Systemd addition\n"
"\n"
"session  required    pam_loginuid.so\n"
"session  optional    pam_systemd.so\n"
"\n"
"# End Systemd addition</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"\n"
"cat &gt; /etc/pam.d/systemd-user &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Begin /etc/pam.d/systemd-user\n"
"\n"
"account  required    pam_access.so\n"
"account  include     system-account\n"
"\n"
"session  required    pam_env.so\n"
"session  required    pam_limits.so\n"
"session  required    pam_loginuid.so\n"
"session  optional    pam_keyinit.so force revoke\n"
"session  optional    pam_systemd.so\n"
"\n"
"auth     required    pam_deny.so\n"
"password required    pam_deny.so\n"
"\n"
"# End /etc/pam.d/systemd-user</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>grep 'pam_systemd' /etc/pam.d/system-session ||\n"
"cat &gt;&gt; /etc/pam.d/system-session &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Inicia adições do Systemd\n"
"\n"
"session  required    pam_loginuid.so\n"
"session  optional    pam_systemd.so\n"
"\n"
"# Termina adições do Systemd</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"\n"
"cat &gt; /etc/pam.d/systemd-user &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Inicia /etc/pam.d/systemd-user\n"
"\n"
"account  required    pam_access.so\n"
"account  include     system-account\n"
"\n"
"session  required    pam_env.so\n"
"session  required    pam_limits.so\n"
"session  required    pam_loginuid.so\n"
"session  optional    pam_keyinit.so force revoke\n"
"session  optional    pam_systemd.so\n"
"\n"
"auth     required    pam_deny.so\n"
"password required    pam_deny.so\n"
"\n"
"# Termina /etc/pam.d/systemd-user</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/systemd.xml:358
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"As the &root; user, replace the running <command>systemd</command> manager "
"(the <command>init</command> process) with the <command>systemd</command> "
"executable newly built and installed:"
msgstr ""
"Como o(a) usuário(a) &root;, substitua o gerenciador "
"<command>systemd</command> em execução (o processo <command>init</command>) "
"pelo executável <command>systemd</command> recém-construído e instalado:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/systemd.xml:363
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>systemctl daemon-reexec</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>systemctl daemon-reexec</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><important><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/systemd.xml:367
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Now ensure <xref linkend='shadow'/> has been already rebuilt with <xref "
"linkend='linux-pam'/> support first, then logout, and login again.  This "
"ensures the running login session registered with <command>systemd-"
"logind</command> and a per-user systemd instance running for each user "
"owning a login session.  Many BLFS packages listing Systemd as a dependency "
"needs the <command>systemd-logind</command> integration and/or a running "
"per-user systemd instance."
msgstr ""
"Agora certifique-se de que <xref linkend='shadow'/> já tenha sido "
"reconstruído com suporte <xref linkend='linux-pam'/> primeiro, depois "
"deslogue-se e logue-se novamente. Isso garante a sessão de login em execução"
" registrada com <command>systemd-logind</command> e uma instância do systemd"
" por usuário(a) executando para cada usuário(a) titularizando uma sessão de "
"login. Muitos pacotes do BLFS que listam o Systemd como uma dependência "
"precisam da integração <command>systemd-logind</command> e (ou) de uma "
"instância do systemd em execução por usuário(a)."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><warning><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/systemd.xml:380
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If upgrading from a previous version of systemd and an initrd is used for "
"system boot, you should generate a new initrd before rebooting the system."
msgstr ""
"Se atualizar a partir de uma versão anterior do \"systemd\" e um \"initrd\" "
"for usado para inicialização do sistema, [então] você deveria gerar um novo "
"\"initrd\" antes de reinicializar o sistema."

